{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":295294,"duration_api_ms":296802,"num_turns":1,"result":"## Project State Summary\n\n**Problem**: GNU coreutils/moreutils lack formal specs. Existing Go reimplementations diverge on edge cases. This project derives specs from C source, generates Go via an AI pipeline, and verifies parity via differential testing against Homebrew reference binaries.\n\n**Architecture**: 4-stage pipeline (extract, specify, synthesize, verify). SRDs define behavior per utility. Claude agents generate Go in cmd/ and pkg/. Differential testing harness (pkg/testutils) runs Go and GNU binaries side-by-side. Shared libraries: pkg/sys (syscalls), pkg/format (output formatting), pkg/hashutil (checksum), pkg/sizeparse (size parsing), pkg/encutil (encoding).\n\n**Current state**: 111 utilities specified, 33 releases. Generation run 44 in progress. Recent commits completed csplit R4.1-R4.4 and the join contract.\n\n**Current release**: 08.1 is the earliest release with ready requirements. Within 08.1: split (done), csplit (done), join (contract done, R2.1-R4.4 ready), fmt (not started, R1.1-R13.4 ready), numfmt/od/printf (not started, all ready).\n\n## Priority Reasoning\n\n1. **join implementation** — contract exists (Task 5455), 12 ready requirements in 3 groups. Can start immediately.\n2. **fmt contract** — no code exists, needed before fmt implementation tasks can be proposed. Independent of join.\n\nnumfmt, od, printf also need contracts but 4-task limit pushes them to next batch.\n\n## Weight Budget Checks\n\nWeights assumed default (1) — requirements.yaml not in project_context. Orchestrator should validate.\n\n- Task 0 (fmt contract): R1.1 (w=1) = **1**\n- Task 1 (join R2.1-R2.4): 4 × w=1 = **4**\n- Task 2 (join R3.1-R3.4): 4 × w=1 = **4**\n- Task 3 (join R4.1-R4.4): 4 × w=1 = **4**\n\nAll within budget.\n\n```yaml\n- index: 0\n  title: \"[stitch] cmd/fmt (contract)\"\n  dependency: -1\n  descripti