o errors\"\n\n- index: 1\n  title: \"[stitch] cmd/join: srd069 R2.1-R2.4\"\n  dependency: -1\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd069-join.yaml (full SRD -- focus on requirements R2.1 through R2.4)\n      - cmd/join/main.go (existing contract with function stubs to fill in)\n      - pkg/testutils/difftest.go (DiffTest struct and RunDiffTests function for differential testing)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/join/main.go\n        action: modify\n        note: \"Implement srd069 R2.1-R2.4 by replacing function stubs with working code\"\n      - path: cmd/join/join_test.go\n        action: create\n        note: \"Differential tests for R2.1-R2.4 using pkg/testutils.RunDiffTests against gjoin\"\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Implement srd069-join R2.1 per the SRD. Read the requirement text from the SRD and implement the specified behavior.\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"Implement srd069-join R2.2 per the SRD. Read the requirement text from the SRD and implement the specified behavior.\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Implement srd069-join R2.3 per the SRD. Read the requirement text from the SRD and implement the specified behavior.\"\n      - id: R4\n        text: \"Implement srd069-join R2.4 per the SRD. Read the requirement text from the SRD and implement the specified behavior.\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Preserve the existing function signatures and types from the contract in cmd/join/main.go. Fill in stub bodies rather than restructuring.\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Use pkg/testutils.RunDiffTests with reference binary gjoin (exec.LookPath). Skip tests if gjoin is not found.\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"Set LC_ALL=C in test environment (via DiffTest.Env) per project locale handling convention\"\n      - id: D4\n        text: \"Create temporary test fixture files in t.TempDir() for two-file join input scenarios\"\n\